OL,4,CBrazil pushes back on Macron calling   
OL,5,Cits meat 'doped'                       
OL,6,GBrazil says it "regrets" a statement   
OL,7,Gby French President Emmanuel Macron    
OL,8,Gwho called Brazilian meat "doped".     
OL,10,FFrance's leader made the comment while 
OL,11,Fmeeting representatives of farming     
OL,12,Funions on Wednesday, during which he   
OL,13,Fcelebrated EU restrictions on imports  
OL,14,Fof Brazilian meat and poultry which    
OL,15,Ftook effect in September.              
OL,17,FIn its statement, the Brazilian        
OL,18,Fgovernment said Macron's statements    
OL,19,F"spread misinformation and contradict  
OL,20,Fthe widely available technical and     
OL,21,Fscientific evidence on animal protein  
OL,22,Fproduction in Brazil".                 
